3118
07:41:03,120 --> 07:41:09,080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: May limitations po ba bilang ng insurance policies na maaaring kunin ng isang

3119
07:41:09,080 --> 07:41:12,300
Atty. Juan Sotero Roman: tao? Depende, Your Honor, on the

3120
07:41:16,670 --> 07:41:23,390
